WEBVTT

1
00:00:03,890 --> 00:00:05,890
Are you sure you want to point a gun at me?

2
00:00:05,890 --> 00:00:07,170
What are you pretending to be?

3
00:00:07,170 --> 00:00:08,650
Get those women over quickly

4
00:00:08,650 --> 00:00:10,690
Otherwise I will break you Chen Biao

5
00:00:10,690 --> 00:00:11,890
what on earth are you going to do

6
00:00:11,890 --> 00:00:16,810
You are committing a crime. Do you know that you are committing a crime?

7
00:00:16,810 --> 00:00:18,850
Miss Liang, Miss Liang

8
00:00:18,850 --> 00:00:21,080
I should laugh at you for righteously daring to hug the shed

9
00:00:21,080 --> 00:00:22,880
Should I laugh at you for being stupid?

10
00:00:22,880 --> 00:00:24,280
They all ignored you, you know?

11
00:00:24,280 --> 00:00:25,880
The gun is in my hand now

12
00:00:25,880 --> 00:00:27,480
My words are the law of heaven

13
00:00:27,480 --> 00:00:33,470
Who is dissatisfied with Chen Biao?

14
00:00:33,470 --> 00:00:35,070
Listen to my advice

15
00:00:35,070 --> 00:00:37,070
It's not too late to give me the gun back now

16
00:00:37,470 --> 00:00:39,870
Do you want to stand on the opposite side of everyone?

17
00:00:39,870 --> 00:00:41,470
Miss Liang

18
00:00:41,470 --> 00:00:44,070
It’s not that I’m on the opposite side of everyone

19
00:00:44,070 --> 00:00:48,070
It's you who stand on the opposite side of everyone.

20
00:00:48,070 --> 00:00:49,870
He just said it

21
00:00:49,870 --> 00:00:51,270
He plans to drive out

22
00:00:51,270 --> 00:00:52,270
place nearby survivors

23
00:00:52,270 --> 00:00:55,560
Why did everyone come to our mall to rescue you?

24
00:00:55,560 --> 00:00:56,960
He wants to bring people in

25
00:00:56,960 --> 00:00:58,360
There are only so many supplies here

26
00:00:58,360 --> 00:01:00,760
What can we eat when people come again?

27
00:01:00,760 --> 00:01:02,160
Don't do it again
